  "result": "I fixed it in `src/lib/csv.ts`. I haven't run the tests or exported a sample file to check it.\n\nThe regex that decides whether a field needs quoting only matched commas and line breaks, not double quotes. A title containing a `\"` was written out raw, so the spreadsheet read the quote as the start of a quoted field and the columns shifted. I added `\"` to the regex. Titles with quotes are now wrapped in quotes with each embedded quote doubled, as RFC 4180 requires.\n\nThis function is shared, so the audit-log export gets the same fix.",
